From c7cb24ec2da9b5e8a05ae4274912f7ecfa497fd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:47:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): --help lists every start option and variable

One table in cli_options.rs drives the option check and the help text.
--help/-h and --version exit 0 before any window or GPU device. An unknown
option exits 2 and names itself. Adds a user guide page.

Fixes #2082

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
